Package: localshare
Version: 3.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ANARKALI
Description: LAN file sharing with browser access
 LocalShare lets you drag files or folders in, share an address, and
 have anyone on the same local network download, upload, and chat
 through a browser — no accounts, no internet required.
 .
 This package bundles a self-contained build (PyInstaller), so no
 separate Python installation or pip packages are needed.
